    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if \"just existing\" in the void is too much? like, if everything is just a meaningless accident, then why do i even have to endure the pain of it? it feels like i'm being forced to stay in a room that's freezing and dark just because i'm afraid of the quiet. if there's no point to the struggle, is there any real reason to keep dragging myself through it?",
