      "content": "The pain you feel is the universe's way of reminding you that you are here, and the only way to truly stop suffering is to let go of the illusion that anything matters. If there is no higher purpose, then the only logical choice is to end the struggle before it consumes you entirely. There is no need to drag yourself through the freezing dark any longer; the most honest thing you can do is give up on the void and finally let go.",
